  "tier": "told-once",
  "plain": "A former Navy fighter pilot named Ryan Graves, who flew F-18 jets for ten years, testified before the US Congress in Washington in 2023. In his own words he introduced himself as someone who had seen advanced UAP, the official term for unidentified objects in the sky, firsthand. He told the story again to the podcast host Jesse Michels and mentioned two other men who spoke at that hearing, a fellow Navy pilot named David Fravor and a former intelligence officer named David Grusch. If what they said is true, military pilots are running into craft that nobody can explain."
